# Normalize line endings to LF for every text file, on every platform and regardless of
# local `core.autocrlf`. Without this, git's common Windows default (`core.autocrlf=true`)
# checks text files out as CRLF even though the committed blobs are LF (as
# `.prettierrc.json`'s `"endOfLine": "lf"` expects), which makes `npm run format:check`
# report the whole tree as unformatted on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touched by line-ending normalization, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
